.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/d7/b3/fc/d7b3fc9b-c7b2-0e60-b0ed-20d5dad82c13/05-yes-no.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/8e/01/69/8e016920-c276-9249-68d7-7a6d01ce32d9/04-gossip-wheel.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/0b/91/6a/0b916a1d-4ad1-398f-40fd-4a4d5c26b7d7/03-verdict.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/90/3a/e7/903ae706-cf06-e72a-a0fd-aba0f9f7cfe3/06-lobby.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/36/d6/4c/36d64c3f-7cc8-7dc2-9533-76da497e7b74/07-most-exposed.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"averageUserRating":4.39177,"trackCensoredName":"Exposed - Who's Most Likely To","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/exposed-whos-most-likely-to/id1553777064?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"17+","formattedPrice":"Free","fileSizeBytes":"66828288","artistId":1504657825,"artistName":"vysgames","genres":["Games","Casual","Trivia"],"price":0.0,"trackId":1553777064,"trackName":"Exposed - Who's Most Likely To","releaseDate":"2021-03-24T07:00:00Z","genreIds":["6014","7003","7018"],"primaryGenreName":"Games","primaryGenreId":6014,"sellerName":"VYS Games","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-09-24T00:24:54Z","releaseNotes":"Find your friends without a PIN: with Bluetooth on, Exposed spots the players right next to you. See who's nearby, or jump into the game a friend just started, in one tap.\n- Invite links: share your lobby and friends land straight in it\n- Memories: every game you played, its cards ready to see and share again\n- Fixes and polish","version":"3.1.1","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Exposed is the party game that finds out who in your group is the most likely to... well, everything.\n\nEach round asks a \"Who's most likely to\" question about the people playing. Everyone taps a face to vote, then the result is revealed to the whole group. Simple, fast, and made for laughing together.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n- One player creates a game and shares the PIN.\n- Friends join from their own phones, in the same room or remotely.\n- Vote, reveal, laugh, repeat.\n\nWHAT'S INSIDE\n- More than 5,000 questions and challenges, so every game night stays fresh\n- Duels: two friends, one question, the group decides\n- Yes or No rounds and the Gossip Wheel for quick-fire fun\n- Several packs to match the mood, from a quiet evening to a big party\n- Light and dark mode\n- A recap card at the end of every game\n\nExposed is a great icebreaker for parties, road trips and catching up with friends.\n\nSome packs require an optional auto-renewing subscription.\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://fluff-jump-74e.notion.site/Terms-of-Service-EULA-Privacy-Policy-8285978bc30d465692cfc7503e230ed2","minimumOsVersion":"16.4","languageCodesISO2A":["EN"],"userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":8237,"trackContentRating":"17+","bundleId":"com.vysgames.Exposed","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.39177,"userRatingCount":8237}